@startuml C2_Update_Operation_Plans_Logical_View
title C2 – PLMS Containers for Operation Plan Updates

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

rectangle "Port Logistics Management System" as PLMS {
  rectangle "Angular SPA" as SPA {
    rectangle "OemOperationPlansComponent" as Component
    rectangle "OemApiService" as ApiService
    rectangle "Reference Data Services\n(Docks, Resources, Staff)" as ReferenceServices
  }

  rectangle "TodoApi (ASP.NET Core)" as Api {
    rectangle "OemProxyController" as Controller
    rectangle "OemClient" as Client
  }
}

cloud "Identity Provider" as IAM
cloud "OEM Operation Planning Service" as OEM
cloud "Resource Catalog APIs" as Catalogs

database "Local Cache / Redis" as Cache

Operator --> Component : Browser interaction (HTTPS)
Component --> ApiService : Angular service calls
ApiService --> Controller : REST JSON (with credentials)
Controller --> Client : Forward OEM requests
Client --> OEM : HTTPS API calls (PATCH/GET)
ApiService --> ReferenceServices : lookups for dropdowns
ReferenceServices --> Catalogs : fetch resource metadata
Controller --> IAM : Adds identity headers
Component --> Cache : optional caching of lists (local storage)

OEM --> Controller : plan snapshots, change logs, warnings
Catalogs --> ReferenceServices : resources, staff, docks

@enduml
